<!-- Launcher icon: a cream path winding up into three ridges of green hills, with the sun
     setting behind the far ridge. Shapes run below the canvas so the adaptive-icon mask never
     shows an edge; the group is lifted 8 units so the foreground hill sits inside the mask. -->
